    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Journey up through the sewers, across lakes and up the tallest tree to catch the fleeting blue butterfly.\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hop through challenging platforming challenges as a cute bunny and see beautifully handmade and cozy world!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482670/extras/44be0f2f8c90c0fb7aa295ae0ec2660c.poster.avif?t=1739048705\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482670/extras/44be0f2f8c90c0fb7aa295ae0ec2660c.webm?t=1739048705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482670/extras/44be0f2f8c90c0fb7aa295ae0ec2660c.mp4?t=1739048705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482670/extras/e014d32372b98577910e3adcf612d9b5.poster.avif?t=1739048705\" width=800 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482670/extras/e014d32372b98577910e3adcf612d9b5.mp4?t=1739048705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Single-player challenging 2D platforming as a cute bunny.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482670/extras/ebf5c5521ff1e61edc66b8ce83311372.poster.avif?t=1739048705\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482670/extras/ebf5c5521ff1e61edc66b8ce83311372.webm?t=1739048705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482670/extras/ebf5c5521ff1e61edc66b8ce83311372.mp4?t=1739048705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A beautifully illustrated world to explore and conquer.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482670/extras/114b25ca6b24c6f7c7013a64006f3540.avif?t=1739048705\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluffy: Checkpoints and Jump Holding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Metal: Increase the difficult/pace with a cool robotic bunny skin to boot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482670/extras/49031dd94a3df098a0b513230b54d624.avif?t=1739048705\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hop In and Discover the Rest!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute animal NPCs with plenty of taunts and dad jokes to make you laugh\u2014or roll your eyes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your Runs! Track your falls!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jiggling and moving platforms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Much many visual effect eye candy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional fun and fiendishly difficult challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sparkles!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3482670/extras/6bc429a7f0e24479a267a5b9c2c2bc71.avif?t=1739048705\" data-has-big width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple and accessible controls!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Point and jump! Hop, hop around with little else needed. Easy to pick up, difficult to master!\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The challenge lies in the timing and rhythm. Enjoy instant respawns and a tight, satisfying feel to your jumps.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse: Point and Click!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard: Directional (wasd / arrow keys) and Spacebar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller: Joystick and equivalent A\u00a0button for jump! (Supports all controllers\u00a0PS/Switch/Xbox, etc)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
