lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple and accessible controls!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Point and jump! Hop, hop around with little else needed. Easy to pick up, difficult to master!\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The challenge lies in the timing and rhythm. Enjoy instant respawns and a tight, satisfying feel to your jumps.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse: Point and Click!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard: Directional (wasd / arrow keys) and Spacebar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller: Joystick and equivalent A\u00a0button for jump! (Supports all controllers\u00a0PS/Switch/Xbox, etc)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
